WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.100
BEFORE YOU WATCH
This tape is made from
real teaching, 1988–2026.
From manuals, booklets, books,
newsletters, posts and news reports.
The name HEDGE™ is invented. The reasons
are theirs.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.200
BEFORE YOU WATCH
Every reason in it was
taught to real people.
Some were first taught
about gay people.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.000
BEFORE YOU WATCH
You can stop it
at any time.

4
00:01:07.936 --> 00:01:17.006
MODULE 1 COMPLETE
THE OLD WOUND · 1988
Module 2 · Catch It Early
unlocks when you're ready.
▶ CONTINUE TO MODULE 2

5
00:03:48.195 --> 00:03:52.895
In their own words, 2019:
“No one is certain what
causes gender confusion.”
Then they listed causes.

6
00:03:53.245 --> 00:03:56.445
First the family.
Then her friends.
Then the whole culture.

7
00:03:56.795 --> 00:03:59.995
Nothing was dropped.
Each reason was added
to the ones before.

8
00:04:00.345 --> 00:04:04.145
Parents were told
to find the wound,
to watch for signs,
to monitor her phone.

9
00:04:04.495 --> 00:04:08.295
Parenthood was made
a political identity;
the child, a figure to
build coalitions around.

10
00:04:08.645 --> 00:04:11.545
At 18, their own post says,
she is free to choose.

11
00:04:11.895 --> 00:04:14.995
Her parents were told:
it can take
seven to ten years.

12
00:04:15.345 --> 00:04:19.345
The WHO: trans-related
identities are not
conditions of
mental ill-health.
